{
"id": 4108,
"iid": 2,
"project_id": 3304,
"title": "UDM is sending wrongly suci as ueid in get subscription-data message to udr",
"description": "while testing the OAI AUSF/UDM/UDR using real AMF from Nokia, the AMF is sending auth request to AUSF using null protected suci, the UDM should de-conceal it and send SUPI as ueid to udr, but it is sending the suci as ueid, that causes auth to fail as udr mysql db has supi as ueid\n\non udm logs\n[2023-06-15 03:47:38.842] [udm_ueau] [debug] GET Request:10.1.10.12:8080/nudr-dr/v1/subscription-data/suci-0-206-01-0000-0-0-5500000000/authentication-data/authentication-subscription\n\non udr logs\n[2023-06-15 03:47:28.833] [udr_mysql] [info] [UE Id suci-0-206-01-0000-0-0-5500000000] MySQL Query: SELECT * FROM Authe\nnticationSubscription WHERE ueid='suci-0-206-01-0000-0-0-5500000000'\n[2023-06-15 03:47:28.835] [udr_mysql] [error] [UE Id suci-0-206-01-0000-0-0-5500000000] AuthenticationSubscription no d\nata\uff01 SQL Query: SELECT * FROM AuthenticationSubscription WHERE ueid='suci-0-206-01-0000-0-0-5500000000'\n[2023-06-15 03:47:28.835] [udr_server] [info] HTTP Response code 404 (HTTP Version 2).",
"state": "closed",
